  "description": "OzaLog — a lean, lightweight .NET local file logging library with a simplest possible static API. No dependency injection required, no LoggerFactory, zero NuGet dependencies on net8+. Designed for high-throughput multi-threaded scenarios such as cryptocurrency tick streams. Note: OzaLog is NOT related to NLog (jkowalski's package); the previous version \"Ozakboy.NLOG\" has been deprecated and renamed to OzaLog.",
