  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0 — Major release. Package renamed from Ozakboy.NLOG to OzaLog (see MIGRATION.md).\n\nBreaking Changes:\n- Package renamed: Ozakboy.NLOG -> OzaLog. Namespace renamed: ozakboy.LOG -> OzaLog.\n- Removed TargetFrameworks: net462, net6.0, net7.0 (all EOL). Now: netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net8.0, net9.0, net10.0.\n- Enum typo fixed: LogLevel.CostomName -> LogLevel.CustomName.\n\nAdded:\n- HFT-grade async pipeline: ConcurrentQueue<struct LogItem> + persistent FileStream pool + 1ms cached timestamp + drop-oldest backpressure.\n- New LogOptions: EnableGlobalExceptionCapture, MaxOpenFileStreams, DiskFlushIntervalMs, OnDropped.\n- OzaLog.Tests xUnit test project; OzaLog.Benchmarks BenchmarkDotNet project (vs. ZLogger / ZeroLog / Serilog).\n\nImproved:\n- Zero NuGet dependencies on net8.0 / net9.0 / net10.0.\n- Formatting moved off the calling thread; persistent FileStreams; background expired-log cleanup.\n\nFixed:\n- Console.WriteLine double-format bug.\n- Auto-flush level selection for Error/Fatal.\n\nSee CHANGELOG.md for the full list. See MIGRATION.md for the upgrade guide from Ozakboy.NLOG v2.x.",
